'''Chop''' was a {{Common}} [[Natural]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costed {{Money|30,000}} or {{Robux|100}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].

Chop allowed the user to separate their body parts, utilizing them to dodge swords, deal close range attacks, and fly.

Chop had gained significant value due to its passive immunity to [[swords|sword]] damage, even when imbued with [[Aura]], making the user extremely effective against players who primarily use [[swords]] in [[PvP mechanics|PvP]]. However, most of its skills suffer from limited range and below-average damage, making it more suitable as a "supporting" [[Blox Fruit]] rather than a primary choice for combat.

